#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:5
#: e7082d2837474a938a046fedd8fa6ee5
msgid "Control a Gimbal / Camera Mount"
msgstr "通过 MAVLink 控制云台/相机挂载"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:7
#: 8230b04551de460ea9ac1f94731e47a4
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used to control a gimbal (aka camera "
"mount).  In particular this page describes how to"
msgstr "本页介绍如何使用 MAVLink 控制云台（即相机挂载）。具体而言，本页描述了如何："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:9
#: 719ec663a725450b9f64c8c1d93cb9c0
msgid "use MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL to set the gimbal's mode (aka mount mode)"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 设置云台模式（即挂载模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:10
#: 8f57e2557faa456fb8088be05f4a0cb6
msgid ""
"use MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW to move to a desired angle or at a "
"desired rate"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW 移动至目标角度或以目标速率运动"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:11
#: 498276ce98474a8dba0661ac37013720
msgid "use MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_LOCATION to point at a Location"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_LOCATION 指向某个位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:12
#: b8badfbeb0eb4e7aa450f092f25c1af6
msgid "use MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_NONE to stop point at a Location or vehicle"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_NONE 停止指向某个位置或飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:13
#: f9eb1ec475c446908fb28ba1362b7544
msgid "use MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID to point at another vehicle"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID 指向另一架飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:14
#: d0355c1a7cd94e5f9165986b1bad6730
msgid ""
"use MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE to take control of the gimbal "
"(optional)"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE 接管云台控制权（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:16
#: 708ecbe344234c67ae7076c456103ca2
msgid ""
"The gimbal's attitude (in body-frame Quaternion form) can be monitored by "
"decoding the `GIMBAL_DEVICE_ATTITUDE_STATUS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GIMBAL_DEVICE_ATTITUDE_STATUS>`__"
" message."
msgstr ""
"可通过解码 `GIMBAL_DEVICE_ATTITUDE_STATUS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GIMBAL_DEVICE_ATTITUDE_STATUS>`__"
" 消息来监控云台的姿态（以机体坐标系四元数形式表示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:20
#: 5cbb9148fe234f7097706e412fded075
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's MAVLink interface for controlling gimbals was significantly "
"upgraded for 4.3 compared with earlier versions. This page primarily "
"discusses the interface for 4.3 (and higher) which aims to comply with the "
"`MAVLink Gimbalv2 protocol "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/gimbal_v2.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"与早期版本相比，ArduPilot 4.3 的云台 MAVLink 控制接口有了重大升级。本页主要讨论 4.3（及更高版本）的接口，该接口旨在遵从 "
"`MAVLink Gimbalv2 协议 <https://mavlink.io/en/services/gimbal_v2.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:24
#: 4578802169f0498d90c107d299ee28da
msgid ""
"The :ref:`user wiki pages for gimbals is here <copter:common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`."
msgstr ":ref:`云台用户 wiki 页面请见此处 <copter:common-cameras-and-gimbals>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:27
#: aa99cf9a85554c9783e883e06adf9520
msgid "Set the mode with MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 设置模式"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:29
#: f54f957c82c545a8a51766ad42370349
msgid ""
"The gimbal/mount's mode can be set by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command and param7 fields set as specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL>`__ "
"command. The supported modes are:"
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL>`__ "
"命令的规范设置 command 和 param7 字段来设定云台/挂载的模式。支持的模式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:32
#: ef070bfe36d74702a78ced8bf2fab5db
msgid ""
"Retract : gimbal will move to a retracted position (see MNT1_RETRACT_X, Y, "
"Z) or relax"
msgstr "Retract（收起）：云台将移动至收起位置（见 MNT1_RETRACT_X, Y, Z）或松弛"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:33
#: 5bba7464a53343598b33ac77627355cb
msgid ""
"Neutral : gimbal will move to a neutral position (see MNT1_NEUTRAL_X, Y, Z)"
msgstr "Neutral（中立）：云台将移动至中立位置（见 MNT1_NEUTRAL_X, Y, Z）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:34
#: f9ad94b7478d491fa3a3ed65c7216d08
msgid ""
"MAVLink Targeting : gimbal's angle or rate targets are controlled via "
"mavlink messages (see MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW).  It is not "
"necessary to specifically change to this mode, this will happen "
"automatically if MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW is sent"
msgstr ""
"MAVLink Targeting（MAVLink 目标控制）：通过 MAVLink 消息控制云台的角度或速率目标（见 "
"MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW）。无需特意切换到此模式，发送 "
"MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW 后将自动切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:35
#: d3c121d0cb2443e0a3a33250cb61863b
msgid ""
"RC Targeting : pilot controls the gimbal angle or rate using RC input (see "
"MNT_RC_IN_PAN/ROLL/TILT and MNT_RC_RATE parameters)"
msgstr ""
"RC Targeting（遥控目标控制）：飞手通过 RC 输入控制云台角度或速率（见 MNT_RC_IN_PAN/ROLL/TILT 及 "
"MNT_RC_RATE 参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:36
#: 539f5bca4e554a1ea844f026ffd16049
msgid ""
"GPS Point: gimbal points towards a Location (Lat, Lon, Alt) (see "
"MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI).  It is not necessary to specifically change to this "
"mode, this will happen automatically if MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI is sent"
msgstr ""
"GPS Point（GPS 点位）：云台指向某个位置（纬度、经度、高度）（见 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI）。无需特意切换到此模式，发送 "
"MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI 后将自动切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:37
#: 277dcf3512524f5c982b88c9090b9aca
msgid ""
"SysId Target: gimbal points towards another vehicle (see "
"MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID).  It is not necessary to specifically change to "
"this mode, this will happen automatically if MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID is "
"sent"
msgstr ""
"SysId Target（系统 ID 目标）：云台指向另一架飞行器（见 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID）。无需特意切换到此模式，发送 "
"MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID 后将自动切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:38
#: dd9fa803bef54e01b33840211d64aa62
msgid "Home Location: gimbal points towards home"
msgstr "Home Location（返航点）：云台指向返航点"

