#: 33ccae9660fb4096acc8805323a78e1b
msgid ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW to move to a desired angle or at a "
"desired rate"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW：移动至目标角度或以目标速率运动"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:133
#: 06292845d5af46deba0596a1ba6228ba
msgid ""
"The gimbal's attitude can be changed to a desired pitch and yaw angle or "
"changed at a desired rate by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command and param1 through param7 fields set as specified for the "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW>`__"
" command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW>`__"
" 命令的规范设置 command 及 param1 至 param7 字段，将云台姿态调整至目标俯仰和偏航角，或以目标速率改变姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:136
#: 42f480b858f2433c9573e86d3795e0f9
msgid ""
"The gimbal's yaw behaviour as the vehicle rotates can also be controlled.  "
"The two behaviour are:"
msgstr "飞行器旋转时云台的偏航行为也可以被控制。两种行为模式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:138
#: 9e8e998a922f4ecaabc91fea4d2dd0fc
msgid "body-frame/follow means the gimbal's yaw will rotate with the vehicle"
msgstr "body-frame/follow（机体坐标系/跟随）：云台偏航将随飞行器一起旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:139
#: 438203f2909f4fe4885ea5059b6f54c7
msgid ""
"earth-frame / lock means the gimbal's yaw will remain fixed and will not "
"rotate with the vehicle"
msgstr "earth-frame/lock（地球坐标系/锁定）：云台偏航将保持固定，不随飞行器旋转"

