#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:229
#: 8e37a5f6e5e04a9caaf0d0ba509d4d54
msgid ""
"The gimbal can be pointed at a Location (Lat, Lon, Alt) by sending a "
"`COMMAND_INT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ "
"with the command and param1 through param6 fields set as specified for the "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_LOCATION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_LOCATION>`__ "
"command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_LOCATION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_LOCATION>`__ "
"命令的规范设置 command 及 param1 至 param6 字段，将云台指向某个位置（纬度、经度、高度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:256
#: 843280881bff4283a16dbc8673b74e78
msgid "Valid options are:"
