#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:341
#: cedab58aa50e49d7915c9900ce6b1379
msgid ""
"The gimbal ROI can be stopped (e.g. the gimbal will switch to its default "
"mode held in the MNT1_DEFLT_MODE param)) by sending a `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ with the command"
" and param1 specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_NONE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_NONE>`__ "
"command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_NONE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_NONE>`__ "
"命令的规范设置 command 和 param1 字段，停止云台的兴趣区域跟踪（例如云台将切换到 MNT1_DEFLT_MODE "
"参数所指定的默认模式）。"

