#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:435
#: 5fd3ec06b39f49d39c0d05e3e3ec6593
msgid ""
"The gimbal can be pointed at another vehicle by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command and param1 fields set as specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID>`__ "
"command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_ROI_SYSID>`__ "
"命令的规范设置 command 和 param1 字段，将云台指向另一架飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:438
#: dc2523845ed14302885ee62f611b1ce2
msgid ""
"This feature relies on the main vehicle receiving the other vehicle's "
"position at regular intervals via the `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_POSITION_INT>`__ message."
msgstr ""
"此功能依赖主飞行器通过 `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_POSITION_INT>`__ "
"消息定期接收另一架飞行器的位置。"

