#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:518
#: e64b8b7b8e344fc18fb40c3dddf0ea81
msgid ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE to take control of the gimbal (optional)"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE：接管云台控制权（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:520
#: 88acd6a3f77446ea8795f2f3ef1e18cc
msgid ""
"The `MAVLink Gimbalv2 protocol "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/gimbal_v2.html#starting--configuring-gimbal-"
"control>`__ includes support for deconflicting commands received "
"simultaneously from multiple MAVLink enabled ground stations using the "
"DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE command.  ArduPilot consumes these commands and "
"reports who is in control using the GIMBAL_MANAGER_STATUS message but does "
"not actually enforce their use due to concerns around backwards "
"compatibility and the number of support calls this would generate."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink Gimbalv2 协议 <https://mavlink.io/en/services/gimbal_v2.html#starting"
"--configuring-gimbal-control>`__ 支持使用 DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE 命令对来自多个 "
"MAVLink 地面站的并发指令进行冲突消解。ArduPilot 会消费这些命令并通过 GIMBAL_MANAGER_STATUS "
"消息上报当前控制方，但出于向后兼容性及可能产生大量支持请求的顾虑，并不实际强制执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-gimbal-mount.rst:522
#: 9f16fb5e7cd34d91b76da45e3e32a4c2
msgid ""
"A ground station (or other MAVLink enabled device) can take control of the "
"gimbal by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command and param1 fields set as specified for the "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE>`__"
" command."
msgstr ""
"地面站（或其他 MAVLink 设备）可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE>`__"
" 命令的规范设置 command 和 param1 字段来接管云台控制权。"

